          "referenceSHA256": "55a8e559a46498e8b3c2d2e883b0b45359b9c089437e4ab8f875834d70243e5e",
          "description": "Exemplar of marine iguana ( Amblyrhynchus cristatus ) lying on a rock in the coast of Las Bachas, Santa Cruz Island , Galápagos Islands , Ecuador."
        }
      ],
